{"about":{"chairperson":{"name":"Bimal Raj Gosai","title":"Chief Executive Officer (CEO), Prefab Panel Nepal Pvt. Ltd.","image":"/images/team/chairperson.jpg","message":"We started in 2024 with a simple goal: help Nepal build better. A year later, our manufacturing plant in Bharatpur, Chitwan came online, backed by an NPR 20 crore investment. Today it turns out 150,000 sq. ft. of Smart Panel a year — lightweight, insulated, and ready for construction sites across the country. Seismic strength isn't an add-on; it's built into every panel we produce. We are proud to be an ISO 9001:2015 certified company committed to modern, sustainable, and earthquake-ready construction for every Nepali community."},"story":"We started in 2024 with a simple goal: help Nepal build better. A year later, our plant in Bharatpur, Chitwan came online, backed by an NPR 20 crore investment. Today it turns out 150,000 sq. ft. of Smart Panel a year — lightweight, insulated, and ready for sites across the country.","mission":"Smart, eco-friendly, earthquake-ready building material so every community can build faster, safer, and for less.","vision":"To lead Nepal's construction transition toward sustainable, pre-engineered, and earthquake-resilient building technologies that protect lives and preserve the environment.","whatWeStandFor":[{"title":"Innovation & Quality","description":"We keep refining how a panel comes together — always a step ahead with advanced automated technology."},{"title":"Safety & Resilience","description":"Seismic strength isn't an add-on. It's built into every panel to withstand Nepal's active seismic zones."},{"title":"Environmental Care","description":"Less topsoil disturbed, fewer emissions released — by design, using non-toxic and recyclable materials."}],"boardOfDirectors":[{"id":"1","name":"Bimal Raj Gosai","position":"Chief Executive Officer (CEO)","image":"/images/team/chairperson.jpg"},{"id":"2","name":"Executive Board Director","position":"Director — Technical & Operations","image":"/images/team/director-1.jpg"},{"id":"3","name":"Executive Board Director","position":"Director — Finance & Strategy","image":"/images/team/director-2.jpg"},{"id":"4","name":"Independent Board Member","position":"Director — Governance","image":"/images/team/director-3.jpg"}],"management":[{"id":"1","name":"Bimal Raj Gosai","position":"Chief Executive Officer","image":"/images/team/chairperson.jpg"},{"id":"2","name":"Head of Plant & Production","position":"Factory Operations — Bharatpur","image":"/images/team/manager-1.jpg"},{"id":"3","name":"Head of Quality & Structural Engineering","position":"Quality Assurance & QC","image":"/images/team/manager-2.jpg"},{"id":"4","name":"Head of Sales & Dealer Network","position":"Nationwide Distribution","image":"/images/team/manager-3.jpg"}]}}